# Root command public front doors (PSR-3a)

## Goal

Expose **twelve** discoverable public commands without deleting compatibility
aliases, without renaming required CI checks, and without merging
`verify:fast` / `verify:product` / `verify:full` / adversarial / live smoke.

Machine map: [`ROOT_COMMAND_FRONT_DOORS.yaml`](./ROOT_COMMAND_FRONT_DOORS.yaml)

## Public front doors

| Command | Points at | Authority / notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `dev` | `scripts/ops/dev-front-door.mjs` | Usage printer (exit 1); pick api/web/portal/marketing |
| `build` | `scripts/monorepo-build.sh` | Artifact build |
| `lint` | existing root lint | Includes package `tsc --noEmit` |
| `typecheck` | `pnpm run lint` | Honest alias — lint scripts are typecheck here |
| `test` | existing root test | Unit/contract aggregation (not full integrity) |
| `verify:fast` | unchanged | Daily invariants |
| `verify:product` | unchanged | Product/workspace static bundle |
| `verify:full` | unchanged | Product + architecture + `ci:integrity` (heavy) |
| `generate` | `generate:workspace-registry` | Regenerates registry outputs |
| `workspace:create` | unchanged | Scaffold workspace package |
| `db:migrate` | `db:migrate:deploy` | **DB side effect** — same as deploy migrate |
| `release:verify` | `verify:product` | Release-candidate static bar only |

## Explicit non-goals (later)

| Wave | Work |
| --- | --- |
| PSR-3b | Family runners accepted; CI composite pilot (`portal-control-guard`) — **done** |
| PSR-3c | Alias expiry (2 more) + phase archival inventory — **done** |
| PSR-4a | Export classification / deprecation map |

## Net script change (this wave)

| Change | Count |
| --- | ---: |
| Front doors added | +5 (`dev`, `typecheck`, `generate`, `db:migrate`, `release:verify`) |
| Deprecated exact aliases removed | −2 (`contract:test`, `test:contract:foundation`) |
| Net | +3 |

`//…` deprecation comment keys for the removed aliases remain as historical
markers. CI must not have required those executable names (docs-only refs).

## Smoke (fast)

```bash
node -e "const s=require('./package.json').scripts; for (const k of ['dev','build','lint','typecheck','test','verify:fast','verify:product','verify:full','generate','workspace:create','db:migrate','release:verify']) { if (!s[k]) { console.error('missing',k); process.exit(1);} } console.log('front-doors: present');"
pnpm run typecheck --if-present 2>/dev/null || pnpm run typecheck
# resolve-only checks (do not run verify:full / db:migrate here):
node -e "console.log(require('./package.json').scripts['release:verify'])"
node -e "console.log(require('./package.json').scripts.generate)"
```
